        <span data-i18n="about.desc1">Without light, you only see an object's silhouette.</span><br>
        <span data-i18n="about.desc2">With light, you see its true form.</span><br><br>
        <span data-i18n="about.desc3">THANKS, LIGHT. is a first-person puzzle adventure</span><br>
