      <div style="background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid rgba(110,192,232,0.08); border-radius:10px; padding:1.5rem;">
        <div style="font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">&#127918;</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--accent-light);" data-i18n="love.card1_title">Portal, Superliminal, The Talos Principle</div>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;" data-i18n="love.card1_desc">You enjoy first-person puzzle games<br>that challenge your perception<br>and reward creative thinking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--bg-card); border:1px solid rgba(110,192,232,0.08); border-radius:10px; padding:1.5rem;">
        <div style="font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">&#127756;</div>
        <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--accent-light);" data-i18n="love.card2_title">INSIDE, Control, Liminal Spaces</div>
